        <mxCell id="H3DCpCM3TB73iOrC_Rii-8" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 51, 51); font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;We will Ask the user the following Questions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1.Annual amount and source of income (including bonus/regular stock grants) for each member of the &lt;br&gt;household ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2.Monthly household budget ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3.List of all investments (or provide spreadsheet/statements): current and previous 401ks, IRAs, investment &lt;br&gt;accounts, directly held stocks and mutual funds, stock options/RSUs, bank account balances. ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4.10. Is there likelihood for an inheritance that you want to count on?  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;5 List debts : balances, monthly payments, interest rates (i.e. mortgage, &lt;br&gt;student loans, auto loans, credit cards, business loans, etc.) ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. List your personal financial goals, both short (within 5 years) and long (5+ years) term: i.e., funding college, &lt;br&gt;new home, home repair/remodel, relocation, annual and one-time lifestyle goals such as travel, business &lt;br&gt;purchase, etc.&amp;nbsp; ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7 What does retirement look like for you (consider retirement age, amount needed monthly, whether you’ll be &lt;br&gt;working part time or consulting in retirement)&amp;nbsp; ?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;8 What are your intentions for leaving money to family/charity upon death?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;9 Is there anything else we should know about you ?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;10How are healthcare costs covered: ?&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;" vertex="1" parent="1">
